/* â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
   G. CARD TRANSITION TIMING â€” prevent jank on navigation
   Detail card opens: use contain to limit paint
   â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â• */

/* containment for static cards */
.chkApp .infoCardTile,
.chkApp .kpiCard,
.chkApp .analyticsTile,
.chkApp .workflowStageCard {
  contain: layout style paint !important;
}

/* containment for scrollable areas */
.chkApp .flatEditorGridTable,
.chkApp .searchResultsTable {
  contain: layout style !important;
}

/* Detail page canvas â€” isolate stacking context */
.chkApp .detailExperienceCanvas {
  isolation: isolate !important;
  contain:   layout !important;
}

/* Promote search results to own layer (stable, large element) */
.chkApp .searchResultsTable {
  will-change: transform !important;
}

/* Do NOT promote static cards */
.chkApp .infoCardTile,
.chkApp .kpiCard,
.chkApp .glassCard {
  will-change: auto !important;
}


/* â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
   H. SKELETON ANIMATION OPTIMIZATION
   Single shared animation, no per-element overhead
   â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â• */

/* Override shimmer to use transform instead of background-position */
@keyframes _skShimmer {
  0%   { transform: translateX(-100%); }
  100% { transform: translateX(100%); }
}

.chkApp .appSkeleton.appSkeletonLine {
  overflow:  hidden !important;
  position:  relative !important;
  animation: none !important;
}

/* Use ::after pseudo-element for shimmer sweep */
.chkApp .appSkeleton.appSkeletonLine::after {
  content:    '' !important;
  position:   absolute !important;
  inset:      0 !important;
  background: linear-gradient(
    90deg,
    transparent 0%,
    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.60) 50%,
    transparent 100%
  ) !important;
  animation: _skShimmer 1.6s ease-in-out infinite !important;
  will-change: transform !important;
}

body.chkAppRoot.appDark .chkApp .appSkeleton.appSkeletonLine::after {
  background: linear-gradient(
    90deg,
    transparent 0%,
    rgba(80, 130, 220, 0.28) 50%,
    transparent 100%
  ) !important;
}

/* Base color of skeleton lines */
body.chkAppRoot.appLight .chkApp .appSkeleton.appSkeletonLine {
  background: rgba(196, 215, 240, 0.55) !important;
}

body.chkAppRoot.appDark .chkApp .appSkeleton.appSkeletonLine {
  background: rgba(30, 50, 90, 0.70) !important;
}

/* Stagger via delay â€” siblings inherit will-change:transform on ::after only */
.chkApp .appSkeletonTableRow:nth-child(2) .appSkeletonLine::after { animation-delay: 120ms !important; }
.chkApp .appSkeletonTableRow:nth-child(3) .appSkeletonLine::after { animation-delay: 240ms !important; }
.chkApp .appSkeletonTableRow:nth-child(4) .appSkeletonLine::after { animation-delay: 360ms !important; }


/* â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
   I. DETAIL CARD NAVIGATION â€” smooth open/close
   Page transitions via opacity+translate, not all properties
   â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â• */

/* appSkeletonReveal â€” faster, transform-based */
@keyframes appSkeletonRevealFade {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(4px); }
  to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}

.chkApp .appSkeletonReveal {
  animation: appSkeletonRevealFade 220ms cubic-bezier(0.22,0.61,0.36,1) both !important;
}

/* Stagger reveal for sections */
