/* â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
   CH 9 Â· KPI entry animation â€” GPU-only, no blur
   â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â• */

@keyframes _kpiCardIn {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px) scale(0.97); }
  to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); }
}

.chkApp .kpiCard.searchAnalyticsCard {
  animation: _kpiCardIn 280ms cubic-bezier(0.22,0.61,0.36,1) both !important;
}

.chkApp .kpiCard:nth-child(1) { animation-delay:  0ms !important; }
.chkApp .kpiCard:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 45ms !important; }
.chkApp .kpiCard:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 90ms !important; }
.chkApp .kpiCard:nth-child(4) { animation-delay:130ms !important; }

/* Number reveal â€” count-up simulation via opacity */
@keyframes _numReveal {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(3px); }
  to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}

.chkApp .kpiCard .sapMTitle.appSkeletonReveal {
  animation: _numReveal 320ms cubic-bezier(0.22,0.61,0.36,1) both !important;
  animation-delay: 80ms !important;
}

/* Table rows appear */
@keyframes _rowIn {
  from { opacity: 0; }
  to   { opacity: 1; }
}

.chkApp .searchResultsTable .sapMListTblRow {
  animation: _rowIn 180ms ease both !important;
}

.chkApp .searchResultsTable .sapMListTblRow:nth-child(1)  { animation-delay:   0ms !important; }
.chkApp .searchResultsTable .sapMListTblRow:nth-child(2)  { animation-delay:  18ms !important; }
.chkApp .searchResultsTable .sapMListTblRow:nth-child(3)  { animation-delay:  36ms !important; }
.chkApp .searchResultsTable .sapMListTblRow:nth-child(4)  { animation-delay:  54ms !important; }
.chkApp .searchResultsTable .sapMListTblRow:nth-child(5)  { animation-delay:  72ms !important; }
.chkApp .searchResultsTable .sapMListTblRow:nth-child(n+6){ animation-delay:  90ms !important; }


